<div data-lang="en">
<p class="maj">Last updated: 25 September 2026</p>
<h1>Privacy policy</h1>
<p class="lead">SikaGlé is a farming advisor on WhatsApp. To answer you, we need some information. This page explains, in plain words, what we collect, why, who sees it, how long we keep it and how you can have it changed or deleted.</p>

<div class="card"><b>In short</b>
<ul>
<li>We use your messages only to advise you and improve the service.</li>
<li>We never sell your data.</li>
<li>Your GPS location is only stored if you share it yourself.</li>
<li>You can ask at any time to see, correct or delete your data: <a href="mailto:contact@sikagle.com">contact@sikagle.com</a>.</li>
</ul></div>

<h2>1. Who is responsible for your data</h2>
<p>The SikaGlé service is operated by <b>Selumi Services</b>, Akassato, Abomey-Calavi, Benin, which is the data controller.<br>Contact: <a href="mailto:contact@sikagle.com">contact@sikagle.com</a></p>

<h2>2. Information we receive</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Your WhatsApp number and profile name</b>, so we know whom to answer.</li>
<li><b>Your messages</b>: texts, voice notes and photos you send to SikaGlé.</li>
<li><b>Your farming profile</b>, if you give it: preferred language, crops, municipality or area.</li>
<li><b>Your exact location</b>, only if you share it yourself in WhatsApp. The latest location replaces the previous one.</li>
<li><b>Your agronomist requests</b> and a short summary of your problem.</li>
<li><b>Your plans and payments</b>: chosen plan, dates, payment status. We never see your Mobile Money PIN or card number.</li>
<li><b>If you belong to a cooperative</b>: which cooperative you are linked to.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Why we use it</h2>
<ul>
<li>To answer your farming questions, taking into account your crop, your area and the weather.</li>
<li>To understand your voice notes and analyse your plant photos.</li>
<li>To connect you with an agronomist when you ask.</li>
<li>To manage your plan (free, Premium or cooperative) and payments.</li>
<li>To remember the conversation, so we don't ask you the same questions again.</li>
<li>To keep the service secure and prevent abuse.</li>
<li>To improve SikaGlé and produce <b>anonymous</b> statistics (for example: the most reported diseases in a region). These statistics can never identify you.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Who can see your information</h2>
<p>We do not sell your data. We only share it with the people and services SikaGlé needs to work:</p>
<ul>
<li><b>The agronomist</b> who calls you back receives your name, number and a summary of your problem, only when you ask for an agronomist.</li>
<li><b>Your cooperative's manager</b>, if you are a member, can see that you are a member. They cannot see your conversations.</li>
<li><b>Our technical providers</b>, who process data to run SikaGlé: the WhatsApp messaging service (Meta), artificial intelligence, hosting and database services, a weather service, and our Mobile Money payment provider. Some artificial intelligence services may also use the content they receive to improve their own tools, so please avoid sending SikaGlé personal information unrelated to your crops.</li>
<li><b>Authorities</b>, only when the law requires it.</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Data processed outside Benin</h2>
<p>Some of these providers are located outside Benin, notably in the United States and the European Union, so your data may be processed there. We choose recognised providers that protect data with encrypted connections and contractual commitments. The detailed list of our providers is available on request at <a href="mailto:contact@sikagle.com">contact@sikagle.com</a>.</p>

<h2>6. How long we keep it</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Conversations and profile</b>: as long as you use SikaGlé, then at most 12 months after your last message. After that they are deleted or anonymised.</li>
<li><b>Agronomist requests</b>: 12 months.</li>
<li><b>Payments</b>: as long as accounting rules require.</li>
<li><b>Technical logs</b>: 12 months at most.</li>
</ul>

<h2>7. Your rights</h2>
<p>Under Benin's Digital Code (Law No. 2017-20), you can at any time:</p>
<ul>
<li>find out what data we hold about you and receive a copy;</li>
<li>have it corrected if it is wrong;</li>
<li>have it deleted;</li>
<li>object to its use, or withdraw your consent;</li>
<li>stop using SikaGlé: simply stop writing.</li>
</ul>
<p>Write to <a href="mailto:contact@sikagle.com">contact@sikagle.com</a> or send your request to SikaGlé on WhatsApp. We answer within one month at most. If you are not satisfied, you can contact <b>APDP</b>, Benin's personal data protection authority (<a href="https://apdp.bj" rel="noopener">apdp.bj</a>).</p>

<h2>8. Security</h2>
<p>Connections to our servers are encrypted. Access to the database is protected and restricted. Messages claiming to come from WhatsApp are verified before being processed. No system is perfect, but we fix any weakness as soon as we know about it.</p>

<h2>9. SikaGlé's advice</h2>
<p>SikaGlé's answers are produced by artificial intelligence from farming documents. They help you decide, but do not replace an agronomist's advice in the field, especially before using a treatment product.</p>

<h2>10. Changes</h2>
<p>If this policy changes, we will update this page and its date. For important changes, we will let you know on WhatsApp.</p>
